title: OpenAI Status: Incidents
agents: openai_statuspage
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Monitors incidents returned by the OpenAI incidents API. The incident-record count is simply the number of records currently returned by the provider and is not a fixed baseline. Service state is determined from unresolved incidents and their impact. When an incident URL is supplied by the provider it is shown in details; otherwise the live status page https://status.openai.com/ is provided. Impact-to-state mapping is configurable.
discovery: One service is created whenever the openai_statuspage agent section is present.
